msgstr "<0>假删除</0>会把该意图置为「已删除」并记录删除原因，意图节点、执行记录、已登记的事实和漏洞<1>都会保留</1>。规划者会收到「该意图由用户删除 + 原因」并据此重新规划。"

#: src/components/agent-editor.tsx
msgid "<0>Task-timeout wrap-up</0> (a <1>separate</1> set from the per-run wrap-up above): injected when the <2>whole task</2> reaches its timeout limit and is about to end. Its intent is often the opposite of per-run (e.g. planner: per-run says “don't stop, keep planning”, task timeout says “stop now, make the final call”). Leave empty to use the built-in default."
msgstr "<0>任务超时收尾</0>（与上面的 per-run 收尾是<1>两套</1>）：当<2>整个任务</2>到达超时上限、即将结束时注入。与 per-run 语义常相反（如 planner：per-run 说“别停继续规划”，任务超时说“到点停止、做最后判定”）。留空则用内置默认。"

