#: src/components/llm/retry.tsx
msgid "A failed model call passes through five retry layers in order, from innermost to outermost:<0> Connection → Empty response → Same-provider safe window → Pool circuit breaker → Intent rerun</0>. The outer layer only kicks in once the inner one is exhausted, so the counts <1>multiply</1> — max out every layer and a single hiccup can burn through dozens of requests. Leave everything empty for the current defaults, identical to the behavior without this page. The first three layers can be overridden per model profile."
msgstr "一次模型调用的失败会依次经过五层重试，由内到外：<0> 建连 → 空响应 → 同 provider 安全窗口 → 轮询熔断 → 意图重跑</0>。内层用尽才轮到外层，所以次数是<1>相乘</1>的——把每层都拉满，一次抖动能烧掉几十次请求。全部留空即当前默认值，与没有这页时的行为完全一致。前三层可以在每个模型配置里单独覆盖。"

