#: src/components/settings/settings-page.tsx
msgid "Every Agent's <0>target traffic</0> egresses through this proxy (hiding the source IP / via a jump host). Supports <1>http / https / socks5</1> and may carry <2>user:pass</2> authentication. Empty = direct connection.<3/>When <4>traffic capture</4> is on, it acts as the <5>upstream</5> of the recording proxy (traffic is still fully recorded, then egresses through this proxy); when capture is off, it's injected directly into the Agent's bash / WebFetch egress. Independent of the web-search proxy and the LLM proxy.<6/><7>Tip</7>: with <8>capture off</8>, socks5 relies on each command-line tool's support for <9>ALL_PROXY</9> (curl works, some tools may ignore it); if you mainly use socks5, turn on traffic capture — on that path the MITM dials out itself, so tools are unaware and it works reliably."
msgstr "所有 Agent 的<0>目标流量</0>经此代理出网（隐藏源 IP / 走跳板）。支持 <1>http / https / socks5</1>，可带 <2>user:pass</2> 认证。留空=直连。<3/>开启<4>流量捕获</4>时，它作为记录代理的<5>上游</5>（流量仍全量落库，再经此代理出网）；关闭捕获时，直接注入 Agent 的 bash / WebFetch 出网。与网络搜索代理、LLM 代理相互独立。<6/><7>提示</7>：socks5 在<8>关闭捕获</8>时依赖各命令行工具对 <9>ALL_PROXY</9> 的支持（curl 可用，部分工具可能忽略）；若主要用 socks5，建议开启流量捕获——此路径由 MITM 亲自拨号，工具无感知、稳定生效。"

