msgid "The maximum tokens a single reply can generate, sent with every request. 0 (default) = don't send this field and let the server default decide. This is separate from the \"Context window\" above: that's the model's total capacity, used only locally to compute the compaction threshold. Setting it too small cuts reasoning models off during the thinking phase, so they can't produce even a one-word answer."
