msgid "This is the <0>master switch + source configuration</0> for web search. Only once it's on can each <1>Agent's configuration</1> individually choose whether to enable <2>web_search</2> (which returns only titles/links/snippets, not the body; fetching the body is WebFetch's job). Web search <3>does not</3> go through the recording proxy and is independent of traffic capture.<4/>Sources: <5>DuckDuckGo (ddgs)</5> (no key needed), <6>Brave (free tier)</6> (needs a Brave API key), <7>Tavily</7> (needs a Tavily API key), or <8>DeepSeek</8> (reuses the current LLM profile). When the master switch is off, each Agent's web-search toggle is unavailable."
msgstr "这是网络搜索的<0>总开关 + 来源配置</0>。开启后，才能在<1>每个 Agent 的配置</1>里单独选择是否启用 <2>web_search</2>（仅返回标题/链接/摘要，不抓取正文；抓取由 WebFetch 负责）。网络搜索<3>不走</3>记录代理，独立于流量捕获。<4/>来源可选 <5>DuckDuckGo（ddgs）</5>（无需 Key）、<6>Brave（免费版）</6>（需填写 Brave API Key）、<7>Tavily</7>（需填写 Tavily API Key）或 <8>DeepSeek</8>（复用当前 LLM 配置）。总开关关闭时，各 Agent 的网络搜索开关不可用。"

