#: src/components/llm/llm-page.tsx
msgid "When enabled, an Agent with <0>no model specified</0> automatically switches to the next profile when the current one is unavailable (insufficient balance / invalid key / rate limited / service error)."
msgstr "开启后，<0>未指定模型</0>的 Agent 在当前配置不可用（余额不足 / Key 失效 / 限流 / 服务异常）时自动切到下一个配置。"

#: src/components/tasks/tasks-page.tsx
msgid "When enabled, creating the task immediately sends “description + goal” as one intent, so the worker starts running without waiting for the first planning round; the planner then takes over to judge/supplement once it finishes. Recommended for scenarios often solved by a single work run, such as CTFs; when disabled, it follows the standard plan-then-execute flow."
msgstr "开启后创建即把「描述+目标」作为一条意图下发，worker 免等首轮规划直接开跑，跑完再由 planner 接手判定/补充。CTF 等常一个 work 直接解决的场景推荐开启；关闭则走标准的先规划再执行。"

#: src/components/settings/settings-page.tsx
msgid "When enabled, each task's <0>operation constraints</0> (the allow/deny entries maintained under \"Operation constraints\" in the task overview) are woven into the matching Agent's system prompt to frame the exploration boundary (e.g. \"test only the current port\", \"no brute forcing\").<1/>Injection into the <2>planner</2> and <3>worker</3> can be controlled separately; both on by default. Switching takes effect immediately (read next round), with no Agent rebuild. Once off, that Agent no longer sees the constraints."
msgstr "开启后，把每个任务的<0>操作约束</0>（在任务总览「操作约束」里维护的 allow/deny 条目）拼进对应 Agent 的系统提示，用来框定探索边界（如「仅测当前端口」「禁止爆破」）。<1/>可分别控制注入到 <2>规划者（planner）</2>与 <3>执行者（worker）</3>；默认都开。切换即时生效（下一轮读取），无需重建 Agent。关闭后该 Agent 不再看到约束。"

#: src/components/settings/settings-page.tsx
msgid "When enabled, every Agent's HTTP traffic is fully recorded to the database through the recording proxy, and the traffic_search / traffic_get tools and proxy settings are injected into the Agent (the prompt includes proxy instructions).<0/>When off (default), no traffic is recorded: the Agent <1>won't</1> get the proxy settings or traffic tools, and the prompt <2>won't</2> include anything proxy-related. Switching rebuilds Agents to take effect immediately."
msgstr "开启后，所有 Agent 的 HTTP 流量经记录代理全量落库，并向 Agent 注入 traffic_search / traffic_get 工具与代理配置（提示词含代理说明）。<0/>关闭（默认）时不记录任何流量：Agent<1>不会</1>拿到代理配置与流量工具，提示词也<2>不含</2>代理相关内容。切换后会即时重建 Agent 生效。"

#: src/components/llm/llm-page.tsx
msgid "When enabled, it won't be used as a failover target (an Agent / task can still select it explicitly). Good for an expensive profile dedicated to one Agent that you don't want burned when others fail."
msgstr "开启后不会被当作故障转移目标（仍可被 Agent / 任务显式指定使用）。适合「只给某个 Agent 专用、不希望别人失败时烧掉」的昂贵配置。"

#: src/components/task-llm-profile-chain.tsx
msgid "When no profile is specified, the task follows the Agent or the global active profile."
msgstr "未指定配置时，任务跟随 Agent 或全局激活配置。"

#: src/components/tasks/tasks-page.tsx
msgid "When the task is created, the selected companies' existing assets are added to “test assets”, and their domains, IPs, CIDRs, ICPs, and company keywords are provided to the Agent as scope context; this doesn't automatically generate intents or force a change to the execution goal."
msgstr "创建任务时会将所选企业当前已有资产加入“测试资产”，并将域名、IP、CIDR、ICP 和企业关键词提供给 Agent 作为范围上下文；不会自动生成意图或强制改变执行目标。"

#: src/components/tasks/tasks-page.tsx
msgid "When the time is up, a graceful wrap-up is triggered (each agent writes back + the planner makes a final ruling), and the task enters the timeout terminal state."
msgstr "到点后触发优雅收尾（各 agent 写回 + planner 终局判定），任务进入 timeout 终态。"

#: src/components/agent-editor.tsx
msgid "When this agent is stopped by a <0>timeout</0> or by <1>running out of turns</1>, the system injects this wrap-up prompt for one final round: first write back anything identified but not yet persisted, then output a one-line summary (so it doesn't end abruptly). Leave empty to use the built-in default."
msgstr "当此 Agent 因<0>超时</0>或<1>步数耗尽</1>被终止时，系统会注入这段「收尾提示词」跑一轮收尾：先把已识别但未落库的内容写回，再输出一句总结（避免烂尾）。留空则使用内置默认。"

#: src/components/tasks/tasks-page.tsx
msgid "When this much time has passed since the last planning round ended / the task started, with no trigger in between, a planning round fires automatically (a backstop against stalls, and a wake-up to supervise the running worker). Minimum 10 minutes."
msgstr "距上轮规划结束/任务开始满该时长且期间无触发，自动触发一轮规划（兜底卡死 + 唤醒去监督在跑的 worker）。下限 10 分钟。"

#: src/components/settings/settings-page.tsx
msgid "Whether these conditions are met is for you to confirm; the system won't block it. Use the \"Test search\" button below to actually run one and verify."
msgstr "是否满足上述条件由你自行确认，系统不做拦截；可用下方「测试搜索」按钮实际跑一次来验证。"

#: src/components/llm/llm-page.tsx
msgid "Which key the limit is sent under. max_tokens is the default and almost all compatible gateways only accept it; OpenAI's official reasoning models (o-series / GPT-5) conversely only accept max_completion_tokens and reject max_tokens with unsupported_parameter."
msgstr "上限发哪个键。max_tokens 是默认，绝大多数兼容网关只认它；OpenAI 官方推理模型（o 系列 / GPT-5）反过来只认 max_completion_tokens，收到 max_tokens 会直接报 unsupported_parameter。"

